                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg273">p. 273</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d275-f2" n="1" xml:id="d275-f2-content">
                <p> John R. Mott, general secretary of the International Committee of Young Men’s
